# 🚀 Deployment Checklist

Use this checklist to ensure a smooth deployment process.

## Pre-Deployment

### Code Quality
- [ ] All tests passing (`pnpm test`)
- [ ] No TypeScript errors (`pnpm type-check`)
- [ ] No linting errors (`pnpm lint`)
- [ ] Build successful (`pnpm build`)
- [ ] Code reviewed and approved
- [ ] Changes merged to main/develop branch

### Environment Setup
- [ ] `.env.production` created and configured
- [ ] All required environment variables set
- [ ] Secrets generated (NEXTAUTH_SECRET, etc.)
- [ ] Database connection string configured
{{#if features.redis}}
- [ ] Redis URL configured
{{/if}}
- [ ] OAuth credentials obtained and configured
{{#if payments.stripe}}
- [ ] Stripe keys (test and live) configured
- [ ] Stripe webhook endpoint configured
{{/if}}

### Database
- [ ] Production database created
- [ ] Database connection tested
- [ ] Backup strategy implemented
- [ ] Migration scripts tested
- [ ] Database user permissions verified
- [ ] Connection pooling configured

### Security
- [ ] HTTPS/SSL certificate ready
- [ ] Security headers configured
- [ ] CORS policy set
- [ ] Rate limiting configured
- [ ] Secrets not committed to Git
- [ ] `.env*` files in `.gitignore`
- [ ] Content Security Policy reviewed
- [ ] API routes properly authenticated

## Deployment

### Platform Setup
- [ ] Platform account created (Vercel/Railway/Fly.io/etc.)
- [ ] Project created in platform
- [ ] Git repository connected
- [ ] Environment variables added to platform
- [ ] Build settings configured
- [ ] Deploy regions selected

### Domain & DNS
- [ ] Domain purchased/available
- [ ] DNS records configured
- [ ] SSL certificate provisioned
- [ ] Domain verified in platform
- [ ] www redirect configured
- [ ] DNS propagation verified

### OAuth Configuration
{{#if auth.github}}
- [ ] GitHub OAuth app created
- [ ] Redirect URI updated: `https://yourdomain.com/api/auth/callback/github`
- [ ] Homepage URL updated
{{/if}}
{{#if auth.google}}
- [ ] Google OAuth app created
- [ ] Authorized redirect URIs updated
- [ ] OAuth consent screen configured
{{/if}}

{{#if payments.stripe}}
### Stripe Configuration
- [ ] Stripe account in production mode
- [ ] Products created in Stripe
- [ ] Prices/plans configured
- [ ] Webhook endpoint added: `https://yourdomain.com/api/webhooks/stripe`
- [ ] Webhook events selected:
  - [ ] `checkout.session.completed`
  - [ ] `customer.subscription.created`
  - [ ] `customer.subscription.updated`
  - [ ] `customer.subscription.deleted`
  - [ ] `invoice.paid`
  - [ ] `invoice.payment_failed`
- [ ] Webhook secret saved to environment variables
- [ ] Test payment completed successfully
{{/if}}

{{#if email.resend}}
### Email Configuration (Resend)
- [ ] Resend account created
- [ ] API key generated
- [ ] Domain verified in Resend
- [ ] From email address configured
- [ ] Test email sent successfully
{{/if}}

{{#if email.sendgrid}}
### Email Configuration (SendGrid)
- [ ] SendGrid account created
- [ ] API key generated
- [ ] Sender identity verified
- [ ] Domain authentication completed
- [ ] Test email sent successfully
{{/if}}

### Database Migration
- [ ] Database backup created
- [ ] Migration script tested in staging
- [ ] Migrations applied to production
- [ ] Database schema verified
- [ ] Rollback plan prepared

### Deployment Execution
- [ ] Deploy to staging first
- [ ] Staging environment tested
- [ ] Deploy to production
- [ ] Health check passing
- [ ] Application accessible
- [ ] No console errors

